OL,3,ADenmark accuses Russia of plotting to  
OL,4,Aassassinate US-Ukrainian rapper        
OL,6,FDenmark's foreign minister said        
OL,7,FRussia's defence attache will now be   
OL,8,Fexpelled.                              
OL,10,FRussia's embassy in Denmark called the 
OL,11,Fallegations "unsubstantiated" and said 
OL,12,FCopenhagen failed to provide evidence  
OL,13,Fof Moscow's involvement.               
